---
/** Runnable을 만드는 세 가지 방법 → 모두 같은 Runnable 객체 → 누구에게나 건넬 수 있음 */
const makers = [
	{
		no: '①',
		title: '클래스로 구현',
		code: 'class MailTask\n    implements Runnable {\n  public void run() {\n    sendMail();\n  }\n}',
	},
	{
		no: '②',
		title: '익명 내부 클래스',
		code: 'new Runnable() {\n  public void run() {\n    sendMail();\n  }\n}',
	},
	{ no: '③', title: '람다', code: '() -> sendMail()', short: true },
];
const takers = ['new Thread(task)', 'executor.submit(task)', 'Thread.ofVirtual()\n  .start(task)'];
---

<figure class="rf">
	<p class="step">만드는 방법 · 점점 짧아짐 →</p>
	<div class="makers">
		{
			makers.map((m) => (
				<div class:list={['maker', { short: m.short }]}>
					<p class="mtitle">
						<span>{m.no}</span>
						{m.title}
					</p>
					<pre>{m.code}</pre>
				</div>
			))
		}
	</div>

	<p class="join">셋 다 같은 것을 만듭니다</p>

	<div class="core">
		<p class="ctitle">Runnable 객체 <span>= run() 하나를 가진 것 = 할 일</span></p>
		<pre>interface Runnable {'{'}
    void run();
{'}'}</pre>
	</div>

	<p class="join">누구에게나 건넬 수 있습니다</p>

	<div class="takers">
		{takers.map((t) => <pre class="taker">{t}</pre>)}
	</div>
	<p class="foot">받은 쪽은 내용은 모르고 <code>run()</code>만 불러 줍니다</p>
</figure>

<style>
	.rf {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 14px 16px 12px;
		background: var(--bg);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-align: center;
	}
	pre {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: 'JetBrains Mono Variable', ui-monospace, monospace;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		text-align: left;
		white-space: pre;
		overflow-x: auto;
	}
	.step,
	.join,
	.foot {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	.step {
		text-align: left;
		margin-bottom: 6px;
	}
	.join {
		margin: 8px 0;
	}
	.join::before {
		content: '↓ ';
		color: var(--accent);
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.makers {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1.1fr 0.9fr;
		gap: 8px;
		align-items: stretch;
	}
	.maker {
		min-width: 0;
		padding: 8px 10px;
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}
	.maker.short {
		border-color: var(--accent);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent-soft);
	}
	.mtitle {
		margin: 0 0 6px;
		font-size: 0.74rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--ink);
		text-align: left;
	}
	.mtitle span {
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-right: 4px;
	}
	.maker pre {
		color: var(--ink-soft);
	}
	.maker.short pre {
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent);
	}
	.core {
		display: inline-block;
		min-width: min(100%, 320px);
		padding: 10px 16px;
		background: var(--accent-soft);
		border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
		border-radius: 10px;
	}
	.ctitle {
		margin: 0 0 6px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 750;
		color: var(--ink);
		text-align: left;
	}
	.ctitle span {
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	.core pre {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.takers {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 8px;
	}
	.taker {
		padding: 8px 10px;
		color: var(--ok);
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ok) 10%, transparent);
		border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ok) 40%, transparent);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}
	.foot {
		margin-top: 8px;
	}
	.foot code {
		font-size: 0.68rem;
	}
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.rf {
			padding: 12px;
		}
		.makers,
		.takers {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
